<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 9.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 9.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Wednesday, April 9 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>			09.04.97     08.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.4980	 6.5188</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3354	 2.3632</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.5662	 4.6064</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.1802	 3.2116</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5211	 0.5223</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7822	 0.7893</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2920	 0.2954</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8522	 6.8900</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.6974	 0.6972</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.2863	 1.2939</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
